<title>HONG KONG: HK's Glorious Sun shares debut at HK$2.20.</title>
<headline>HK's Glorious Sun shares debut at HK$2.20.</headline>
<text>
<p>Glorious Sun offered a total 250 million new shares earlier this month, comprising a public offer of 100 million shares and a placement of 150 million, at HK$1.60 per share.</p>
<p>Its retail portion was was 236 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company  said it would use the proceeds to develop and expand its Jeanswest retail network in China, Australia and New Zealand.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
